:: Journal Repeat Quests [nobr]

From this menu, you can reenact quests you have already completed. <br> <span style="color: gold">PS.: Some quests have different outcomes based on your boy's skills.</span>
<br>

<div style="margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 150px">
    <<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: The Price of Fame")>>
        [[Replay Lucas's Home Confort Intro | Quest Lucas Home Comfort Intro]]
        <<set $replay to 1>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: The Price of Fame")>>
        [[Replay Lucas's Home Confort Part 1 | Quest Lucas Home Comfort Part 1]]
        <<set $replay to 1>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: Punishment Game")>>
        [[Replay Lucas's PG Quest Chain | Lucas Quest PG Intro]]
        <<set $replay to 1>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
</div>

